  "description_short": "George's largest shopping mall with diverse food court options and casual dining restaurants.",
  "description_long": "Garden Route Mall sits on the N2 Highway at the entrance to George, offering a convenient stop for travelers and locals alike. The expansive food court features everything from quick bites to sit-down meals, with chain restaurants and coffee shops providing familiar favorites. It's a practical choice when you need a break from the road or want casual dining while shopping.\n\nThe mall's central location makes it easy to grab a meal before catching a movie or after browsing the stores. With ample parking and wheelchair access throughout, it's a straightforward option for families and groups looking for variety under one roof.",
